{"resourceIdentifier":"4812","resourceName":"Project Terre Boost: Biochar for a Better Tomorrow","description":"India's agricultural sector faces pressing environmental challenges, notably due to conventional waste disposal methods such as open field burning and unmanaged biomass decay. These practices contribute significantly to greenhouse gas emissions and broader environmental degradation. Addressing this, Together for Restoration (a program by SRCNatura Sure Pvt. Ltd.) introduces Project Terre Boost, an initiative aimed at transforming agricultural residues into biochar for soil enhancement across seven Indian states—Assam, Nagaland, Rajasthan, Maharashtra, Madhya Pradesh, Chhattisgarh, and Jharkhand. \r\n \r\nProject Terre Boost employs flame curtain pyrolysis technology in steel-shielded soil pits to convert agricultural waste into biochar. This biochar, mixed with manure and applied deep into the soil, promises a sustainable solution to waste management in agriculture. The project includes an initial cohort of 5,000 farmers (biochar producers). Environmental impacts of Project Terre Boost are substantial, with an estimated annual removal of 116,961 tons of CO2 equivalent (tCO2e), totalling 818,727 tCO2e over a seven-year crediting period. Moreover, the advantages of Project Terre Boost transcend environmental considerations, creating a dual advantage by significantly elevating the welfare of marginalised local farming communities.","location":{"latitude":20.697796,"longitude":77.391613},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-11-22","endExclusive":"2023-12-23","endInclusive":"2023-12-22"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4812"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"SRCNatura Sure Pvt. Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"NCT, India"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"116961"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0044"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"RINA Services S.p.A"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"24/06/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/01/2024 - 31/12/2030"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=102557&IDKEY=8lksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098141426103","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Project Terre Boost Listing Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-11-21T19:30:05.573Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=102635&IDKEY=n903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdfd141533665","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_PCP_4812_12NOV2023.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-11-22T20:43:24.673Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=133844&IDKEY=kq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfha184570876","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"Terre Boost PD 2.1 Clean copy.pdf","uploadDate":"2025-06-24T12:03:53.463Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=133846&IDKEY=3iquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfj184573634","documentType":"Validation Report","documentName":"FVR_VCS 4812_clean version.pdf","uploadDate":"2025-06-24T12:05:41.49Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_ISSUANCE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Issuance Documents","documents":[]},{"code"